    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43276" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sĕcūrĭclātus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		securicula, II.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Shaped like a hatchet-head</i>, <i>dovetailed</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cardines,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					10, 15</span></i>
